      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u771f\u5b9e footprint(\u7f16\u8bd1\u9a8c\u8bc1):tall 3-stage \u5757 = 258\u00d7258 PE\u3014strip 2 + \u5de6\u5217 128:A1 80\u2191 / gap 16 / A3 160\u2193 \u2016 \u53f3\u5217 A2 128\u00d7256\u3015\u00b7 fat \u5757 = ATTN 256\u00d7256 + FFN 256\u00d7256",
